msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「（I know! That's it!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Ya sé! ¡Eso es!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's what I want to ask＿Kawashima......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eso es lo que quiero pedirle＿a Kawashima......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima, I have a favor to ask.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kawashima, tengo un favor que pedirte.」"

msgid "Ami「What is it?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I want to remember everything about＿you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Quiero recordar todo sobre ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「We've spent time together just the two＿of us, right? Tell me about it before＿you go. Please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pasamos tiempo juntos a solas,＿¿verdad? Cuéntame sobre eso antes＿de irte. Por favor.」"

msgid "Ami「......Are you serious?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Hablas en serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí.」"

msgid "Ami「I see......」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ami「Let's see. The first time we met was＿during Golden Week of last year.」"
msgstr "Ami「Veamos. La primera vez que nos＿vimos fue durante la Semana＿Dorada del año pasado.」"

msgid "Ami「We met through a mutual friend.」"
msgstr "Ami「Nos conocimos por un amigo en común.」"

msgid "\"Oh jeez～ I'm so embarrassed you＿ruined his first impression of me with＿that～\""
msgstr "\"Ay, por Dios～ Qué vergüenza que＿arruinaras su primera impresión de mí＿con eso～\""

msgid "\"Hmmm? Airheaded?\""
msgstr "\"¿Mmmm? ¿Despistada?\""

msgid "\"Yeah. Ami, this is my best friend,＿Takasu Ryuuji. He looks scary, but he's＿a big softy.\""
msgstr "\"Sí. Ami, él es mi mejor amigo,＿Takasu Ryuuji. Parece dar miedo, pero＿es un buenazo.\""

msgid "\"I don't mind if you're scared. I'm used＿to it.\""
msgstr "\"No me importa si te asustas. Estoy＿acostumbrado.\""

msgid "\"Huh? Oh, nice to meet you,＿Ryuuji-kun!\""
msgstr "\"¿Eh? ¡Ah, mucho gusto,＿Ryuuji-kun!\""

msgid "\"......Same.\""
msgstr "\"......Igualmente.\""

msgid "Ami「That was how we met. Fairly typical for＿a beautiful airhead and a scary-looking＿boy.」"
msgstr "Ami「Así fue como nos conocimos. Bastante＿típico de una hermosa despistada y＿un chico de aspecto temible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ami「Summer break was when their＿relationship changed.」"
msgstr "Ami「Las vacaciones de verano fueron＿cuando su relación cambió.」"

msgid "\"Ami, you don't have to act so tough.\""
msgstr "\"Ami, no tienes que hacerte la fuerte.\""

msgid "\"Huh? What are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"¿Eh? ¿De qué estás hablando?\""

msgid "\"It's painful to watch you force a smile＿onto your face like that.\""
msgstr "\"Duele verte forzar así una sonrisa.\""

msgid "\"I can stay by your side. Side by side,＿we can face anything together.\""
msgstr "\"Puedo quedarme a tu lado. Lado a lado,＿podemos enfrentar lo que sea juntos.\""

msgid "\"Can't you just be yourself around me?\""
msgstr "\"¿No puedes simplemente ser tú misma＿conmigo?\""

msgid "\"Ryuuji-kun......\""
msgstr "\"Ryuuji-kun......\""

msgid "Ami「And then the scary-looking boy saw＿through it. No one had ever seen＿through her before.」"
msgstr "Ami「Y entonces el chico de aspecto temible＿la desenmascaró. Nadie había visto＿antes cómo era en realidad.」"

msgid "Ami「Realizing her true feelings, the girl＿began to avoid him.」"
msgstr "Ami「Al darse cuenta de sus＿verdaderos sentimientos,＿la chica empezó a evitarlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Ami「Who knows? ......Because she knew she＿was an outsider, perhaps.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quién sabe? ......Porque sabía＿que era una extraña, quizá.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......An outsider?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Una extraña?」"

msgid "Ami「Still, at the Culture Festival and the＿Christmas party, they gradually＿became closer and closer.」"
msgstr "Ami「Aun así, en el Festival Cultural y＿la fiesta de Navidad, poco a poco se＿volvieron más y más cercanos.」"

msgid "Ami「Then, on Christmas Eve......」"
msgstr "Ami「Luego, en Nochebuena......」"

msgid "\"Ami!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ami!\""

msgid "\"Ryuuji-kun......\""
msgstr "\"Ryuuji-kun......\""

msgid "\"I want...... to treasure you forever.\""
msgstr "\"Quiero...... atesorarte para siempre.\""

msgid "\"..................\""
msgstr "\"..................\""

msgid "\"So please, stay by my side.\""
msgstr "\"Así que por favor, quédate a mi lado.\""

msgid "\"............Okay!\""
msgstr "\"............¡Está bien!\""

msgid "Ami「And so they lived happily ever after.」"
msgstr "Ami「Y así vivieron felices para siempre.」"

msgid "Ami「The End...... I guess that wasn't very＿funny.」"
msgstr "Ami「Fin...... Supongo que no＿tuvo mucha gracia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu. Now, let's stop reminiscing.」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju. Bueno, dejemos de recordar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tú............」"

msgid "Ami「What? Have I helped you get a little of＿your memory back?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué? ¿Te ayudé a recuperar＿un poco de tu memoria?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Till the bitter end, you......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Hasta el último momento, tú......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You lie as much as you frickin'＿breathe......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mientes tanto como respiras,＿demonios......」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? What are you talking＿about? Ami-chan doesn't get it.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quéee～? ¿De qué estás hablando?＿Ami-chan no entiende.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Does that lie contain the \"truth\" you＿want to believe in?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Esa mentira contiene la \"verdad\"＿en la que quieres creer?」"

msgid "Ami「............Who knows? Maybe.」"
msgstr "Ami「............¿Quién sabe? Tal vez.」"

msgid "Ami「I gotta get going. I'm out of time.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya me tengo que ir. Se＿me acabó el tiempo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ami「I know! I'll let you have this DVD. I don't＿feel like keeping it.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Ya sé! Te daré este DVD. No＿tengo ganas de quedármelo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you sure?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Estás segura?」"

msgid "Ami「I'm just giving it to you. Don't watch it.」"
msgstr "Ami「Solo te lo doy. No lo veas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the point then?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué sentido tiene entonces?」"

msgid "Ami「Bye, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Ami「Adiós, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima! I......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Kawashima! Yo......」"

msgid "Ami「......What?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... Take care.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... Cuídate.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Goodbye.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Adiós.」"

msgid "Ami「......Goodbye.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Adiós.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That said, Kawashima walked away.＿She didn't look back. Not once.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dicho eso, Kawashima se alejó. No＿miró atrás. Ni una sola vez.」"

msgid "\"Takasu, let me introduce you. This is＿my childhood friend, Kawashima Ami.＿She's airheaded and a little dumb, so\""
msgstr "\"Takasu, te la presento. Es mi amiga＿de la infancia, Kawashima Ami.＿Es despistada y un poco tonta, así que\""

msgid "please look after her.」"
msgstr "por favor cuida de ella.」"

msgid "Ami「The reputedly \"scary-looking\" boy was＿actually the nicest guy ever, and he＿handled the beautiful airhead's stalker」"
msgstr "Ami「El chico de supuesto \"aspecto temible\"＿era en realidad el más amable, y＿resolvió el problema del acosador de」"

msgid "Ami「problem.」"
msgstr "Ami「la hermosa despistada.」"

msgid "Ami「Behind that smile, the beautiful＿airhead had put up walls between＿herself and the world so she wouldn't」"
msgstr "Ami「Detrás de esa sonrisa, la hermosa＿despistada había levantado muros entre＿ella y el mundo para no salir」"

msgid "Ami「get hurt.」"
msgstr "Ami「lastimada.」"

msgid "Ami「But, perhaps unbeknownst to the girl,＿she could be herself around the boy＿because she had learned to forgive」"
msgstr "Ami「Pero, quizá sin que ella lo supiera,＿podía ser ella misma junto al chico＿porque había aprendido a perdonarse」"

msgid "Ami「herself.」"
msgstr "Ami「a sí misma.」"
